    "missing": [],
    "verdict_notes": "The reader's 'challenges' label on V6 is overreach. The comparison is cross-family with confounded training, tuning and quantization, and GPT-4's 1,760B is an unofficial figure. 'Claude2-13b' is actually Claude2-alpaca-13b, a Llama-2 fine-tune. The Llama3 model is 8B. Mixtral's 46.7B is a mixture-of-experts total parameter count. The study cites Kaplan et al. only to frame its question."
  },
